  "nominal_feeder_limits": "Existing 3.594 mm/1.20 mm outer path, 1.118 mm/0.80 mm outer feed, 0.50 mm/0.30 mm spur and two 0.40/0.20 mm vias. 35 um outer copper and 20\u201325 um barrel plating are nominal assumptions; excludes R9, plane, FPGA escape, package, ground return, temperature and process tolerance. New plane depth uses observed twelve-layer stackup and is not independent vendor qualification.",
  "release_limitations": [
    "Native continuity and rules do not qualify FPGA power-up, transient rail limits, timing, firmware, thermal behavior or manufacturing yield.",
    "Mounted bypass network has multiple capacitor lands sharing a single mounting via, contrary to the preferred one-to-one mounting guidance; acceptability needs layout improvement or integrated PDN evidence.",
