    "30 um power-plane copper has lower nominal sheet resistance, but dense via antipads change spreading paths. Aggregate sampled copper widths are not connected bottleneck widths or extracted resistance bounds.",
    "Controlled-rise, current-limited custom 12 V adapter and qualified custom cable required; ordinary HDMI is invalid. No onboard source eFuse/damping is asserted.",
